eals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@mizusoba/works/321", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 224129, "client_id": 2227934, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/41dfb8f8/uploads/origins/0320ef1c-77ac-4de7-91f7-739dcd7d2f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa49f7eef8f2840fdfa5e3e23fb0c5c3", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/41dfb8f8/uploads/origins/0320ef1c-77ac-4de7-91f7-739dcd7d2f83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8c83060ca66323cc884a2680f225b082", "src_set": ""}, "body": "雛ちゃんブレイカー2ndBreakをいつも楽しませてもらっている者です\nキジん正邪という物部はとや山城たか、魂魄ヨウムのような感じで雉が鬼人正邪のコスプレをしたようなものを描いてほしいです\nまた完成した絵を雛ちゃんブレイカー2ndBreakにスキンとして実装してくれるとありがたいです\nよろしくお願いします", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mizusoba/works/320", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 224129, "client_id": 1431226, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/22bba112/uploads/origins/22e4c370-05ea-4925-ad18-2b71cb8b2685?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffe167eb640d64d863f8230526e7ef3b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/22bba112/uploads/origins/22e4c370-05ea-4925-ad18-2b71cb8b2685?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=21bcf9e8dc492ae8697f30cc42d1b8b3", "src_set": ""}, "body": "再びこんにちは！以前はAngra Menogのアートをありがとうございました。今回は私の東方OCである歌姫千景の依頼をお願いしたいと思います。\n\nグーグルドライブのリンクに歌姫の登場例がいろいろあります。悪役のように振る舞うが、すぐに慌てるドジな夜雀だ。ドSな悪役として描くもよし、コミカルに慌てふためくもよし！お任せします。\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vOvm34yeTz2BhszOdpLijN03eu0nwlbf?usp=drive_link", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mizusoba/works/319", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0853d593/uploads/origins/9c96b916-1f3e-4828-8552-b85d927c415c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c5601b8b8e3b7a1a35af5f853fb3f873", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 224129, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mizusoba/works/318", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 224129, "client_id": 1955575, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c47e58e/uploads/origins/18d67fe4-4694-4b7c-94dd-e83c7520202c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=607cc481dd4b1b68210b34616eb4ab4b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c47e58e/uploads/origins/18d67fe4-4694-4b7c-94dd-e83c7520202c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=199c2a94c6f1662eecb7edd6460e849f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめまして、fmkと申します。いすぃさんの作品を拝見させてもらってます。\n\n今回はうちのこのイラストを描いていだたきたいです！\n使用用途、壁紙やアイコンなどの個人利用\n\nキャラ詳細\n・12歳の金髪ロングヘアー\n・赤と青のオッドアイ\n・男の娘\n・155cmくらい\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/zk50aky3wrtybxp08bino/41_20221230023133.PNG?rlkey=mfwoi4rlvnyv3hew0jb9ijx0m&st=h9o58m2v&dl=0\nそしてめっちゃ変なお願いなのですがこのクリーチャーに追いかけて回されるよう感じでお願いします！\n\nぜひよろしくお願いします。\n参考資料\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/scmwe435perpssv/icon_3455.PNG?dl=0", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mizusoba/works/317", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 224129, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/080b1761/uploads/origins/b800056b-3bc9-425c-bded-b879abb07301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=66fb7bfb66beecfcf49f0fce99ff23ee", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/080b1761/uploads/origins/b800056b-3bc9-425c-bded-b879abb07301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a7422318609a0a036f990713432bc517", "src_set": ""}, "body": "以前のレースクイーン紫苑ちゃんと、女苑ちゃんのカーボンフリーズがとてもよかったので、姉妹で一緒にというイメージで『カーボンフリーズされてしまったレースクイーン紫苑ちゃん』をお願いしたいです。\n\n紫苑ちゃんの表情は驚きと恐怖が合わさったような表情で、少しひきつった感じ。\n服装はレースクイーン(資料参照)\n\nポーズや背景はおまかせしますが、へそが見える構図でお願いします。\n\n難しい箇所、分からない箇所はお任せします。\n\nご縁がありましたらよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19Ph6oOuajnAF1Jka3fupk6xkgQ7tzvPy?usp=drive_link", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mizusoba/works/316", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 224129, "client_id": 891955, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e534885e/uploads/origins/deee7b64-eeb8-42c9-8563-9c3c8326ab45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab402365461c317d60e34f1418fbeccc", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e534885e/uploads/origins/deee7b64-eeb8-42c9-8563-9c3c8326ab45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=605aad3c906f0bb222ce8f6e1a138351", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは。\n今回依頼させていただくものは、\n「雛ちゃんがニトリロボに監視されながら棒にカウンターを延々と取り付ける作業をしているイラスト」です。\nどういうものかの参考URLを貼り付けますのでご参照ください。\n\n巨大数研究Wiki 永遠の努力\nhttps://googology.fandom.com/ja/wiki/永遠の努力\nカウンターを１０個作ったら１億円貰えるバイト\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8bzjFujCDIU\n\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mizusoba/works/315", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 224129, "client_id": 3339076, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a85bb57/uploads/origins/4666efb2-3908-4a73-8356-e305688d98ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfed009de70fef37f8f5834627764800", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a85bb57/uploads/origins/4666efb2-3908-4a73-8356-e305688d98ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d1432497cb528006a3f9b83c56c3e10e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello Isui, I have decided to repay the many good memories and hours spent playing Hinabure by requesting a skin to be hopefully implemented in the game. \n\nIt is simply a sleeping Komachi on a throne wearing a crown. It would be funny to see her in a pose of a brooding king, because she'd be asleep while doing so. Any jewelry or royal artifact is welcome to be added, I'm not particularly creative so please surprise me. \n\nI hope I'm doing this the right way. Please enjoy your day, and thanks once again for this great game.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mizusoba/works/314", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 224129, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/396a14b0/uploads/origins/25192def-2eed-4a3b-ab91-6a4cb532989a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccomp