スト。）\n\n星霜のロケットリュックのロケットノズルから、弱々しい炎と煙を途切れ途切れに噴射している感じでお願いします。\n\n星霜の表情はまずいかも、とアワアワしている感じでお願いします。\n\nまた、星霜の構図は、獣神化前のイラスト（https://images.app.goo.gl/rgKwkvRmEQaewSMp9）の様な状態で、体をバタバタさせて、慌てている感じにして下さい。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mizusoba/works/293", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 224129, "client_id": 629484, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c715425/uploads/origins/73deeef7-fb4c-41f4-aea6-c4bb1620ad35?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8bee7038bf5225de6f896c45a0601613", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c715425/uploads/origins/73deeef7-fb4c-41f4-aea6-c4bb1620ad35?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b5b6bf71beaf6d60a6435c5449ad98a7", "src_set": ""}, "body": "いつもお世話になってます。\n早苗さんの爆乳絵をお願いいたします。\n下の慧音先生くらいの大きさで、幽香みたいに腕を上げているポーズだと大変嬉しいです。\n\n慧音：https://x.com/mizusoba/status/1862681008820429168/photo/1\n幽香：https://x.com/mizusoba/status/1869613995218587928/photo/1", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mizusoba/works/292", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 224129, "client_id": 482488, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4eed3443/uploads/origins/d694534c-13e5-4a82-b38f-15a1024631d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db1134e510418a5e0919a7457da8af4b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4eed3443/uploads/origins/d694534c-13e5-4a82-b38f-15a1024631d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=79023e541b152b0f7f6f2633410b4cb8", "src_set": ""}, "body": "最新話を読んで脳を焼き尽くされてしまったので、絶望の表情で立ち尽くしている人間時代の瑞霊をお願いします。\n構図は本編と同じような感じで左肘の怪我もできればそのまま、範囲は膝上位まで写っていれば大丈夫です。\nどうかよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 39523, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ゆゆず", "screen_name": "yuyuzu11", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1879269464824561664/wDYcJmPu.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/943424228711284736/1740224123/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "video"}], "nc": 144}, {"id": 508646, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "snuq@SKEB/STOPx4", "screen_name": "nonorenew", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1615717476104560640/5hqkL5Q_.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1218418223357427712/1667391458/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 1999571, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "牛木義隆@fanbox", "screen_name": "yosihiki", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1518455139064958977/ThUdKYjd.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/47563784/1747274818/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 257